  textString:
  - Read
  - june 26th, 1892
  - Mansion Candlelight has been officially recognized as common heritage of humanity,
    having housed important historic figures like don Jonatan I. The mansion is an
    example of mixed styles of victorian architecture, characteristic of the country's
    transition from empire to republic. The mansion will be open to visits at a later,
    unspecified date.
